# Secrets and personal data never enter this repository.
# The athlete profile holds weight, thresholds and health notes; the database holds every
# decision, conversation and workout photo; the LLM journal holds exactly what was sent to the
# model about the athlete. Examples of the first two live next to them as *.example.*.
